    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The serfs are rebelling and nobles are being defenestrated! Fortunately, your advisors are convincing the populace and nobles that you're here to help. As long as nobody notices your plans to prepare street food for the vampires then everybody will be satisfied.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design Your Kingdom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/499031845331f97f7a99d1e39651872d.poster.avif?t=1753971948\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/499031845331f97f7a99d1e39651872d.webm?t=1753971948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/499031845331f97f7a99d1e39651872d.mp4?t=1753971948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your lands the way that you want to. Gather people and resources to continue your territory's growth. Tax your citizens' production to earn coins, and spend your coins to build homes for your advisors and facilities to train them. Then, prepare (the vampires) for the night shift!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Debate Your Opposition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/e2fac5646035cf03d66fada54a18604c.poster.avif?t=1753971948\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/e2fac5646035cf03d66fada54a18604c.webm?t=1753971948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/e2fac5646035cf03d66fada54a18604c.mp4?t=1753971948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit advisors from dozens of different types of commoners and nobles. Help them grow the way that you want them to, and win debates to get your way!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit as many people as you want so that you can handle any personality type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put together a team of five advisors that can manage any opposition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach them presentation styles that will convince anybody to agree with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Debate more to earn experience and raise their grade.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defenestrate Other Nobles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/908bccc4802985bb90bb1e24c11c15ef.poster.avif?t=1753971948\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/908bccc4802985bb90bb1e24c11c15ef.webm?t=1753971948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/908bccc4802985bb90bb1e24c11c15ef.mp4?t=1753971948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation is everything! Whether it's yours or somebody else's reputation you'll have to keep it where the vampire queen wants it. The nobles' reputations are in your hands. Take control over their lands by debating them until they're convinced of your &quot;genius&quot; ideas.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance the game by keeping noble reputations where they benefit you most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Debate nobles when they disagree with you to keep your plans on track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let anybody find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get caught by the nobles or the populace. Nobody's told them that the king's already dead or that the queen is being held hostage yet, and for your sake and theirs you will want it to stay that way!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The serfs are rebelling and nobles are being defenestrated! Fortunately, your advisors are convincing the populace and nobles that you're here to help. As long as nobody notices your plans to prepare street food for the vampires then everybody will be satisfied.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design Your Kingdom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/499031845331f97f7a99d1e39651872d.poster.avif?t=1753971948\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/499031845331f97f7a99d1e39651872d.webm?t=1753971948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/499031845331f97f7a99d1e39651872d.mp4?t=1753971948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build out your lands the way that you want to. Gather people and resources to continue your territory's growth. Tax your citizens' production to earn coins, and spend your coins to build homes for your advisors and facilities to train them. Then, prepare (the vampires) for the night shift!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Debate Your Opposition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/e2fac5646035cf03d66fada54a18604c.poster.avif?t=1753971948\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/e2fac5646035cf03d66fada54a18604c.webm?t=1753971948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/e2fac5646035cf03d66fada54a18604c.mp4?t=1753971948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit advisors from dozens of different types of commoners and nobles. Help them grow the way that you want them to, and win debates to get your way!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit as many people as you want so that you can handle any personality type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put together a team of five advisors that can manage any opposition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teach them presentation styles that will convince anybody to agree with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Debate more to earn experience and raise their grade.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defenestrate Other Nobles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/908bccc4802985bb90bb1e24c11c15ef.poster.avif?t=1753971948\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/908bccc4802985bb90bb1e24c11c15ef.webm?t=1753971948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3187890/extras/908bccc4802985bb90bb1e24c11c15ef.mp4?t=1753971948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reputation is everything! Whether it's yours or somebody else's reputation you'll have to keep it where the vampire queen wants it. The nobles' reputations are in your hands. Take control over their lands by debating them until they're convinced of your &quot;genius&quot; ideas.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance the game by keeping noble reputations where they benefit you most.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Debate nobles when they disagree with you to keep your plans on track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let anybody find out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't get caught by the nobles or the populace. Nobody's told them that the king's already dead or that the queen is being held hostage yet, and for your sake and theirs you will want it to stay that way!</p>",
